### Retrieve incident details from mock data
GET http://localhost:8000/api/incidents/INC000001

### Retrieve datafix records from mock data
GET http://localhost:8000/api/datafixes/INC000001

### Invalid incident number format
GET http://localhost:8000/api/incidents/INVALID

### Valid format, incident not found
GET http://localhost:8000/api/incidents/INC999999

